  "description": "Short Term Let – Lighthouse Apartments, East Wall, Dublin 3\n\nSHORT TERM RENTAL ONLY - 3-6 months\n\nAvailable for short-term rental, a spacious and well-presented two-bedroom apartment comprises a entrance hall, two double bedrooms (largest with ensuite),  bathroom and a bright open-plan living and dining area with a fully fitted kitchen.\n\nThe property benefits from a small patio area and one secure designated underground car park space. Communal well maintained area.  Set behind security gates\n\nVery convenient location, close to Aldi, Lidl, McDonalds, Starbucks.  Close to East Point Business Park, Grand Canal, with Fairview and Clontarf on door step.  Convenient for city centre, IFSC and Docklands as well as the airport. \nThe area is well served by public transport, Dublin Bus routes and nearby Luas and DART services. \n\n\n\n\n",
